{"sha": "e36689c6a189b9183ef52713dbe0b2a19374e8dcf710d90f1fb7e25fab2513ff", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g7:negatives:sub}", "每个减法都化为加法，再", "使用\\cref{met:g7:negatives:add}：", "\\begin{align*}", "5 - 9 &= 5 + (-9) = -4, \\\\", "(-3) - (+4) &= (-3) + (-4) = -7, \\\\", "(-2) - (-6) &= (-2) + (+6) = +4 .", "\\end{align*}", "最后一行是最著名的结论：\\emph{减去一个负数，", "等于做加法}。去掉一笔债务，你就更富有了！", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[温差]\\label{ex:g7:negatives:temperature}", "某一天内，气温从 $-6$ 度升至 $+9$ 度。", "升温量即为下面的差", "\\[", "9 - (-6) = 9 + 6 = 15 \\text{ 度}.", "\\]", "在数轴上，从 $-6$ 升到 $0$ 为 $6$ 度，从 $0$ 到", "$9$ 又升了 $9$ 度。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{平面上的坐标}", "", "\\begin{definition}[带符号的坐标]\\label{def:g7:negatives:coords}", "在原点 $O$ 处相交的两条互相垂直的带刻度数轴上，", "平面上每一点都对应一对正负数坐标 $(x, y)$：", "$x$ 为负表示在纵轴左侧，$y$ 为负表示在", "横轴下方。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\draw[gray!40, thin] (-4.4,-3.4) grid (4.4,3.4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-4.6,0) -- (4.6,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-3.6) -- (0,3.6) node[left, font=\\small] {$y$};", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {$O$};", "  \\foreach \\x in {-4,-2,2,4} \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\x,0)", "    {$\\x$};", "  \\foreach \\y in {-2,2} \\node[left, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,\\y) {$\\y$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (3,2) circle (2.4pt)", "    node[above right, font=\\small] {$A(3, 2)$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (-2,3) circle (2.4pt)", "    node[above left, font=\\small] {$B(-2, 3)$};", "  \\fill[omMeth] (-3,-2) circle (2.4pt)", "    node[below left, font=\\small] {$C(-3, -2)$};", "  \\fill[omProp] (2,-3) circle (2.4pt)", "    node[below right, font=\\small] {$D(2, -3)$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 平面的每个象限中各有一个点。", "先读横坐标，总是如此。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:1}", "求下列各数的相反数：$7$；\\ $-3.5$；\\ $0$；\\ $+12$。再补全：", "“两个数的和为~？时，它们互为相反数”。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:2}", "抄写并填入 $<$ 或 $>$：", "\\[", "-4 \\;?\\; 1, \\qquad", "-4 \\;?\\; -7, \\qquad", "-2.5 \\;?\\; -2.4, \\qquad", "0 \\;?\\; -0.1 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:3}", "按从小到大的顺序排列：$-3$；\\ $2.5$；\\ $-0.5$；\\ $-3.1$；", "\\ $0$；\\ $1$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:4}", "计算：", "\\[", "(-5) + (-9), \\qquad", "(-12) + (+7), \\qquad", "(+3.5) + (-1.5), \\qquad", "(-6) + (+6).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:5}", "化为加法，再计算：", "\\[", "4 - 11, \\qquad", "(-5) - (+3), \\qquad", "(-7) - (-10), \\qquad", "0 - (-8).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:6}", "运用巧妙分组计算（先算互为相反数的数）：", "\\[", "(+7) + (-12) + (+3) + (-8), \\qquad", "(-5.5) + (+9) + (-4.5) + (+1).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g7:negatives:7}", "今天早晨气温为 $-3$ 度，白天上升了 $8$ 度，", "夜间又下降了 $12$ 度。写出一个算式，", "求出最终气温并计算。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}